app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204988518", "author": {"steamid": "76561198264696860", "personaname": "Bob", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198264696860/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 108, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 108, "last_played": 1750419000, "avatar": "c98c326b183a6a9355491019340defcba1a15e9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "No where on the the tags for this game said it was a battle royal. I found that out like 12 minutes into playing, I hate battle royals. FromSoft just robbed me out of 40 bucks.", "timestamp_created": 1758583003, "timestamp_updated": 1758583003, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.398550719022750854", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204985562", "author": {"steamid": "76561198060393296", "personaname": "luispau", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Luispau/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 7350, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6921, "last_played": 1768816268, "avatar": "97018c95578487622bee2b316519f5055d34f396"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very balanced,casual and replayable. I only wish i had friends to play it with :steamsad:", "timestamp_created": 1758580235, "timestamp_updated": 1758580235, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204984126", "author": {"steamid": "76561198130012825", "personaname": "CoolBlue75", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198130012825/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 106, "playtime_forever": 15526, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3248, "last_played": 1768889288, "avatar": "75fffe6eade3ced602ba7ec28acd5bc94b57677e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I thought this game would be slop and I guess it kind of is but it's very fun. I would always do co-op in previous souls games and loved it. To me its just a fantasy multiplayer game I can play with others. I really like the twist on the miyazaki formula here, which is what I was EXPECTING from base game Elden Ring. Characters here are characterized well, and have stories that you can follow and make sense of without reading some random item in your inventory. I really like the rainy and dark vibe going on as well. All characters are fun to play and viable(?) (looking at you Revenant) and its a good time all around. Now just imagine how much more powerful I would be if I could see what the boss was doing through the stuttering slideshow that this game is sometimes.", "timestamp_created": 1758578796, "timestamp_updated": 1758578796, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204983254", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051626618", "personaname": "Vlad Krapula", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198051626618/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 6104, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3467, "last_played": 1760133973, "avatar": "98c4f72cd74b5e337d7d63e19f1874cb615e7def"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's pretty insane to think how good of a product we get to play each time from these guys. Looks, sounds and plays extremely well. The only \"sad\" thing is that you won't get to take it in when you are mostly zooming everywhere but after a while you start thinking what you are actually playing. Faster, tighter and more fleshed out combat compared to anything they have done except maby ac series. This company just keeps cooking and I am definitely looking forward to what they can do next.", "timestamp_created": 1758577954, "timestamp_updated": 1758578528, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204982705", "author": {"steamid": "76561199792518120", "personaname": "عامر", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199792518120/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 14666, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11157, "last_played": 1789175396, "avatar": "d65ea1077b6f55e8cc8c3796eb1ff486c87ee8a5"}, "language": "english", "review": "WOW", "timestamp_created": 1758577412, "timestamp_updated": 1758577412, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}]}